### Obtener jobs programados con rango de fechas — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getScheduledJobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59"
}

### Sin filtros (body vacío, usa defaults del SP) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getScheduledJobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getScheduledJobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59"
}

### Validación: startDate con formato inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getScheduledJobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "no-es-una-fecha",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59"
}
